{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>A young man, a Hebrew slave.</b> He feared lest they elevate him to greatness and he would hate him for not having mentioned him as he had asked of him; therefore he brought an evil report against him. Another interpretation: lest the king be angry at him for not having told him until now that there is so great a sage in the land — therefore he demeaned him."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:08:12.881812200Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}